{"title":"2014 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/3/1536f9b73d2c7e2b69c3bb9149ffa378ce557771.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"52\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/8/5c8eb2cb0cf3c53328e172b4cf6f48f09f2f8e9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y \\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"42\" height=\"17\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/b/20b7c0ed5fff260ee64f0bff0002cbd04dc531b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x - y)(2x + y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"124\" height=\"20\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/b/b6b8831b6d807032a5e5f3b6755ee5585bf2fb57.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\   5y^{2} \\qquad \t\\textbf{(B)}\\   y^{2} \\qquad \t\\textbf{(C)}\\   3y^{2} \\qquad \t\\textbf{(D)}\\   6y^{2} \\qquad \t\\textbf{(E)}\\   4y^{2} \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"460\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/3/1536f9b73d2c7e2b69c3bb9149ffa378ce557771.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"52\" height=\"15\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/5/3754d51b14f6ab547340494f3c0ccbe7067d73b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2y - y)(2 \\times 2y + y) = y(4y + y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"261\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f501ab5700ac23e7e5ad77aa6de24a19061ea9e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=y \\times 5y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"71\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/e/eaeaa6ba07053fd323b5ec70b24ecaed8dc4575b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{\\textbf {(A) } 5y^{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"94\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2014 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 14\">2014 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 14</a></li></ul>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley\" title=\"2014 CEMC Cayley\">2014 CEMC Cayley</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Cayley Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Cayley Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">